 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Disciplinary Committee Members and Gals want to Understand each Other"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "風紀委員とギャルは分かり合いたい"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Fuukiin to Gal wa Wakari Aitai"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Minato Sudo, now in his second year of high school, has become a member of the discipline committee, just like last year. Just as he is determined to maintain discipline this year, he meets his classmate, the gal Himemiya Aika. Sudo points out that she is completely against discipline, with her short skirt, exposed chest, and heavily dyed brown hair... but as he gets to know her, his heart gradually changes...",
   "ja": "高校2年生になった須藤湊は、昨年と同様、風紀委員となった。今年も風紀を正していこうと意気込んでいたところ、クラスメイトのギャル・姫宮愛香に出会う。短いスカート、開かれた胸元、がっつり茶色に染まった髪……と風紀を真っ向から逆らう彼女を須藤は指摘するのだが、彼女を知るにつれ、次第に心が変化していき――？"
  },
